# Line endings (2026-09-16). The index already stores every text file with LF;
# this stops Windows checkouts converting to CRLF and the LF->CRLF warnings on
# every git command. PowerShell scripts run by Task Scheduler on the owner's
# laptop keep CRLF, the Windows-native form.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
